msgid ""
"Creates compressed textures (WebP or KTX2)for every texture. For already "
"compressed textures, nothing happens"
msgstr ""
"Skapar komprimerade texturer (WebP eller KTX2) för varje textur. Redan "
"komprimerade texturer lämnas oförändrade"

